      "name": "get_financial_context",
      "description": "Read-only compact FinancialContext JSON. Includes status.position, status.accounts, transaction index total/months, recurring, budgets, goals, snapshots, liabilities, holdings, and health. The status.position field is a point-in-time (as-of-date) balance snapshot, separate from transaction and behavior windows. A null position means no position snapshot is available. Transaction items are not inline; use get_transactions for items.",
